@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<div class="container mt-4">
    <h2 class="mb-3">About RePurpose</h2>

    <p>
        At <strong>RePurpose</strong>, we are passionate about giving old technology a second life.
        Based in the vibrant city of Durban, our mission is to reduce electronic waste by collecting outdated or unused tech devices from government departments and private companies.
    </p>

    <p>
        We carefully extract usable components, refurbish them, and transform them into affordable, repurposed tech products that are sold through our online platforms.
        By doing this, we help minimize the harmful effects of e-waste on the environment while providing communities and businesses with cost-effective tech solutions.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our work contributes to a cleaner, greener Durban by ensuring that less tech waste ends up in landfills, while promoting a sustainable circular economy.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-4">
        <h4>Our Core Values</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>🌍 Environmental Responsibility</li>
            <li>♻️ Circular Economy & Sustainability</li>
            <li>💡 Innovation in Tech Recycling</li>
            <li>🤝 Partnerships with Businesses & Government</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-4">
        Join us in our journey to make Durban a cleaner, smarter, and more sustainable city.
    </p>
</div>
